<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Certificado de Evaluación Médica Ocupacional</title>
</head>

<style>
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    table-layout: fixed;
    /* Weighted outer border */
    border: 2px solid #000;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    page-break-inside: avoid;
  }

  .border-heavy-left {
    border-left: 2px solid #000 !important;
  }

  .border-heavy-right {
    border-right: 2px solid #000 !important;
  }

  .border-heavy-top {
    border-top: 2px solid #000 !important;
  }

  .border-heavy-bottom {
    border-bottom: 2px solid #000 !important;
  }

  td,
  th {
    /* Soft/Thin inner borders */
    border: 1px solid #d8d8d8;
    padding: 1px 3px;
    font-size: 7px;
    height: 14px;
    word-wrap: break-word;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* White inner borders for colored headers to mimic Excel */
  .section-title td,
  .item-title,
  .item-subtitle {
    border: 1px solid #d8d8d8;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: bold;
    background: #ccf;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .item-title {
    background-color: #ccffcc;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .item-subtitle {
    background-color: #ccffff;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .text-vertical {
    writing-mode: sideways-lr;
    text-align: center;
    width: 15px;
    height: auto;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .center {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .left {
    text-align: left;
  }

  .right {
    text-align: right;
  }

  .bold {
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .border-none {
    border: none !important;
  }

  .no-border-top {
    border-top: none !important;
  }

  .no-border-bottom {
    border-bottom: none !important;
  }

  .no-border-left {
    border-left: none !important;
  }

  .no-border-right {
    border-right: none !important;
  }
</style>

<body>
  {{#if logo}}
  <div style="width: 100%; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;">
    <img src="{{logo}}" alt="" style="height: 30px;">
  </div>
  {{/if}}
  <!-- Main Title -->
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th class="section-title" colspan="12">CERTIFICADO - EVALUACIÓN MÉDICA OCUPACIONAL</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
  </table>

  <!-- Section A: Establishment and User Data -->
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td class="section-title" colspan="12">A. Datos del establecimiento</td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td class="item-title" colspan="2">Institución del Sistema</td>
        <td class="item-title" colspan="2">RUC</td>
        <td class="item-title" colspan="2">CIIU</td>
        <td class="item-title" colspan="2">Establecimiento / Centro de Trabajo</td>
        <td class="item-title" colspan="2">Número de Historia Clinica</td>
        <td class="item-title" colspan="2">Número de Archivo</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2">{{establishment.institutionName}}</td>
        <td colspan="2">{{establishment.ruc}}</td>
        <td colspan="2">{{establishment.ciiu}}</td>
        <td colspan="2">{{establishment.healthFacility}}</td>
        <td colspan="2">{{establishment.clinicalHistoryNumber}}</td>
        <td colspan="2">{{establishment.fileNumber}}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="item-title" colspan="2">Primer Apellido</td>
        <td class="item-title" colspan="2">Segundo Apellido</td>
        <td class="item-title" colspan="2">Primer Nombre</td>
        <td class="item-title" colspan="2">Segundo Nombre</td>
        <td class="item-title" colspan="2">Sexo</td>
        <td class="item-title" colspan="2">Puesto de Trabajo (CIUO)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2">{{patient.firstName}}</td>
        <td colspan="2">{{patient.middleName}}</td>
        <td colspan="2">{{patient.lastName}}</td>
        <td colspan="2">{{patient.secondLastName}}</td>
        <td colspan="2">{{patient.gender}}</td>
        <td colspan="2">{{patient.jobPosition}}</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <!-- Section B: General Data -->
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td class="section-title" colspan="12">B. Datos Generales</td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td class="border-none" colspan="12"></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="border-none" colspan="3" rowspan="2">Fecha de Emisión</td>
        <td>{{generalData.emision.year}}</td>
        <td>{{generalData.emision.month}}</td>
        <td>{{generalData.emision.date}}</td>
        <td class="border-none" colspan="6" rowspan="2"></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="border-none">aaaa</td>
        <td class="border-none">mm</td>
        <td class="border-none">dd</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="border-none" colspan="12"></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="border-none">Evaluación:</td>
        <td class="border-none right">Ingreso</td>
        <td>{{#if generalData.evaluationType.isEntry}}x{{/if}}</td>
        <td class="border-none right">Periodico</td>
        <td>{{#if generalData.evaluationType.isPeriodic}}x{{/if}}</td>
        <td class="border-none right">Reintegro</td>
        <td>{{#if generalData.evaluationType.isReturn}}x{{/if}}</td>
        <td class="border-none right">Retiro</td>
        <td>{{#if generalData.evaluationType.isRetirement}}x{{/if}}</td>
        <td class="border-none" colspan="3"></td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td class="border-none" colspan="12"></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <!-- Section C: Medical Fitness Assessment -->
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td class="section-title" colspan="12">C. Aptitud Médica para el Trabajo</td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="12">
          Después de la valoración médica ocupacional se certifica que la persona en mención, es calificada como:
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="item-title" colspan="2">Apto</td>
        <td>{{#if fitness.isFit}}x{{/if}}</td>
        <td class="item-title" colspan="2">Apto con Restricciones</td>
        <td>{{#if fitness.isFitObservation}}x{{/if}}</td>
        <td class="item-title" colspan="2">No Apto Temporal</td>
        <td>{{#if fitness.isFitLimitation}}x{{/if}}</td>
        <td class="item-title" colspan="2">No Apto Permanente</td>
        <td>{{#if fitness.isNoFit}}x{{/if}}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="border-none" colspan="12">DETALLE DE OBSERVACIONES:</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="border-none" colspan="12">{{fitness.observation}}</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <!-- Section D: Recommendations and Observations -->
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td class="section-title" colspan="12">D. Recomendaciones/Observaciones</td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td class="border-none bold" colspan="12">Descripción:</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="border-none" colspan="12">{{recommendation.observation}}</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td class="item-title left">
          Con este documento certifico que el trabajador se ha sometido a la evaluación médica
          requerida para (el
          ingreso /la ejecución/ el reingreso y retiro) al puesto laboral y se le ha informado sobre los riesgos
          relacionados con el trabajo emitiendo recomendaciones relacionadas con su estado de salud.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="left">
          La presente certificación se expide con base en el formulario de Evaluación Ocupacional , el cual tiene
          carácter de confidencial.
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <table class="border-none">
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td class="section-title border-heavy-top border-heavy-left border-heavy-right" colspan="8">E. DATOS DEL
          PROFESIONAL</td>
        <td class="border-none" rowspan="2"></td>
        <td class="section-title border-heavy-top border-heavy-left border-heavy-right" colspan="3">F. FIRMA O HUELLA
          DEL TRABAJADOR</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="border-heavy-bottom border-heavy-left item-title left" colspan="2">Nombre y Apellido:</td>
        <td class="border-heavy-bottom" colspan="2">{{professionalData.fullName}}
        </td>
        <td class="border-heavy-bottom item-title left">Código
          Médico:</td>
        <td class="border-heavy-bottom">
          {{professionalData.medicalCode}}</td>
        <td class="border-heavy-bottom item-title left">Firma y Sello
          Médico:</td>
        <td class="border-heavy-bottom border-heavy-right"></td>
        <td class="border-heavy-bottom border-heavy-left border-heavy-right" colspan="3" style="height: 48px;"></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</body>

</html>